{"2380300": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Super Cars (Amiga/C64/CPC/Spectrum)", "steam_appid": 2380300, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "Originally released in 1990, this top-down combat racer from the creators of the Lotus Esprit Turbo Challenge games saw players take the wheel of a high-powered super car in an all-out deadly race. Now, relive those days in this remastered emulated version.<br><br>Contains the Commodore Amiga, Commodore 64, Amstrad CPC, and ZX Spectrum versions of the game.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Gameplay</h2>Compete in a series of dangerous races. Use your prize money to upgrade your car, adding everything from a turbocharger to missiles!<br><br><br>This enhanced version introduces a number of modern features to this retro classic, including:<br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> Saving/loading the game at any point<br></li><li> Support for most modern game controllers<br></li><li> Full control remapping<br></li><li> Image scaling and smoothing options</li></ul>", "about_the_game": "Originally released in 1990, this top-down combat racer from the creators of the Lotus Esprit Turbo Challenge games saw players take the wheel of a high-powered super car in an all-out deadly race. Now, relive those days in this remastered emulated version.<br><br>Contains the Commodore Amiga, Commodore 64, Amstrad CPC, and ZX Spectrum versions of the game.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Gameplay</h2>Compete in a series of dangerous races. Use your prize money to upgrade your car, adding everything from a turbocharger to missiles!<br><br><br>This enhanced version introduces a number of modern features to this retro classic, including:<br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> Saving/loading the game at any point<br></li><li> Support for most modern game controllers<br></li><li> Full control remapping<br></li><li> Image scaling and smoothing options</li></ul>", "short_description": "In this top-down combat racer from 1990, take the wheel of a high